---
title: Sequence Diagram — Agent Confirmation Gate Middleware (HTTP 403)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Retail Client
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as Express API
    participant MW as Confirmation Audit Hook
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant MCP as MCP Write Tool
    participant SC as LocalBank Contract

    U->>FE: "Yes, proceed" (affirmative consent)
    FE->>API: POST /agent/tools/submit_loan_application
    Note over API,MW: Write-tool POST intercepted before handler

    API->>MW: Hook 1 — confirmation audit (Phase II)
    MW->>DB: Query CHAT_MESSAGE + AGENT_ACTION_LOG<br/>for session_id + confirmation turn
    MW->>MW: Match confirmation_turn_id<br/>to pending action params

    alt No confirmation turn found
        MW->>DB: INSERT agent_action_log<br/>(status=REJECTED · HTTP 403)
        MW-->>API: Block request
        API-->>FE: HTTP 403 Forbidden<br/>"Confirmation required"
        FE-->>U: Action blocked — confirm first
        Note over MW: Zero-bypass: independent of model output
    else Confirmation verified
        MW->>MW: Injection scan passed (L2)
        MW->>MCP: Forward to write tool handler
        MCP->>API: POST /api/loan/apply
        API->>SC: applyLoan (EIP-7702 session key)
        SC-->>API: emit LoanApplied
        API->>DB: INSERT agent_action_log<br/>(tool_name · confirmation_turn_id · tx_hash)
        API-->>FE: 200 OK + reference
        FE-->>U: "Application submitted · L-4821"
    end

    Note over MW: Hook 2 (Phase III): session_key_scope pre-check<br/>Hook 3 (Phase IV): AML iForest pre-check
